# been, the five counters and the census vanish, and the jetson AND pi images are byte-identical to
# baseline. Every wire-in is a same-line fold, so no panic `Location` moves. The ARMED polarity is
# type-checked by the `arm-tegra-orindefer` leg of KERNEL_CFG_MATRIX, never by this mapping.
# UNFLOWN — no Orin has booted it. Witness on the wire: `[orindefer] census … -> DEFERRED` /
